OverTheWire Bandit: Level 31 → 32

Objective
Obtain the password for Level 32.
The password is revealed after pushing a correctly formatted commit to a Git repository.

Steps
Log in as bandit31 and clone the repository:
ssh bandit31@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
git clone ssh://bandit31@localhost/home/bandit31-git/repo
cd repo
Check the instructions in the repository:
cat README.md
Create the required file with the specified content:
echo "May I come in?" > key.txt
Add, commit, and push the changes:
git add key.txt
git commit -m "Add key file"
git push

Result
The server responds with the password for Bandit Level 32.
